@k.words.lion.noun.1 k.words.sense word=lion pos=noun n=1 gloss="large gregarious predatory feline of Africa and India having a tawny coat with a shaggy mane in the male" synonym="king of beasts" synonym="Panthera leo" is_a="big cat" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
